72 350 Td () Tj
72 336 Td () Tj
72 322 Td (1. NIST SP 800-90B, Recommendation for the Entropy Sources Used for Random Bit Generation.) Tj
72 308 Td (2. NIST FIPS 202, SHA-3 Standard: Permutation-Based Hash and Extendable-Output Functions.) Tj
72 294 Td (3. NIST EntropyAssessment Tool \(SP 800-90B reference implementation\).) Tj
